sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as API handler
  participant D as _database_write wrapper
  participant S as Store method (e.g. add_parcel)
  participant DB as Neon PostgreSQL
  H->>D: call store.add_parcel(draft)
  D->>D: acquire process-wide RLock
  D->>DB: psycopg.connect(DATABASE_URL, connect_timeout=15)
  D->>DB: SELECT state FROM public.courier_app_state WHERE singleton = TRUE FOR UPDATE
  DB-->>D: current state row (row is now locked)
  D->>S: run method on the freshly loaded state
  S->>S: validate, mutate in-memory state
  S->>DB: UPDATE ... SET state = %s, version = version + 1, updated_at = NOW()
  alt method raises an exception
    S-->>D: ApiError
    D->>DB: connection closes with rollback (no write)
    D-->>H: error propagates to handler
  else success
    D->>DB: connection closes with commit
    D-->>H: return value
  end
